WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.625
Want to build something useful?

2
00:00:02.907 --> 00:00:05.101
Let's make a habit tracker, with a crew

3
00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:07.841
of AI coding agents and one calm place

4
00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:08.511
to steer.

5
00:00:08.735 --> 00:00:09.916
This is Wheelhouse.

6
00:00:10.024 --> 00:00:11.812
Open the chat and tell Firstmate what you

7
00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:14.795
want: daily habits, a weekly streak, and a

8
00:00:14.795 --> 00:00:16.220
clean mobile layout.

9
00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:19.451
Add a file, dictate, or mention a task

10
00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:20.899
to keep the context together.

11
00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:22.641
The task appears on deck.

12
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:25.209
A worker picks it up, and its own

13
00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:27.587
page brings the brief, live progress,

14
00:00:27.671 --> 00:00:30.780
conversation, and checks into one timeline.

15
00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:34.228
Open Changes to inspect the actual diff.

16
00:00:34.927 --> 00:00:37.389
Here's a decision: should streaks reset at

17
00:00:37.389 --> 00:00:40.056
