18
00:00:40.756 --> 00:00:42.877
Firstmate recommends local time.

19
00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:45.736
Pick it, tap Decide, and the crew carries

20
00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:46.186
on.

21
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.949
Your judgment, right where you need it.

22
00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:51.773
Now the habit tracker is running inside

23
00:00:51.773 --> 00:00:52.618
Wheelhouse.

24
00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:54.220
Tick a habit.

25
00:00:54.803 --> 00:00:55.903
Try the layout.

26
00:00:56.011 --> 00:00:58.736
Use the preview helper to gather feedback, then

27
00:00:58.739 --> 00:01:00.048
