41
00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:32.881
Zoom out to Harbour for every project.

42
00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:35.945
Radar shows work flowing through its stages.

43
00:01:36.169 --> 00:01:39.733
Decisions, the bell, the logbook, time, and

44
00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:42.342
