47
00:01:45.886 --> 00:01:49.308
Plugins add pages, project tabs, and chat cards.

48
00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:51.363
Enable the ones you need.

49
00:01:51.587 --> 00:01:54.640
Connect project links, GitHub issues, shared

50
00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:57.276
reviews, and team knowledge without leaving the

51
00:01:57.276 --> 00:01:57.830
work.

52
00:01:58.414 --> 00:02:00.988
The Vault gives projects access to secrets by

53
00:02:00.991 --> 00:02:01.534
