60
00:02:15.225 --> 00:02:17.857
The setup wizard guides your first launch.

61
00:02:18.557 --> 00:02:21.433
Settings keeps plugins and updates close by.

62
00:02:21.843 --> 00:02:23.186
Start with an idea.

63
00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.846
Keep your crew moving.

64
00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.318
Build something worth shipping, with Wheelhouse.
